{"kind":"table","sheet":"Template","address":"A1:E37","rows":37,"cols":5,"values":[["It is recommended that you do not edit rubrics in spreadsheet format",null,null,null,null],["v1.0-s",null,null,null,null],["Supplied game design",null,null,null,null],["Catch the Star sprites, starts, goal, controls, score, and obstacle.",null,null,null,null],[null,14,10,5,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"All 8 supplied elements are implemented accurately.","6–7 are accurate.","3–5 are accurate.","0–2 are accurate."],["Input mapping",null,null,null,null],["A/left and B/right mappings and labeled hardware fallback.",null,null,null,null],[null,14,10,5,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"Both directions work and mapping is explained accurately.","Both work; explanation has one gap.","One direction works or mapping is incomplete.","No working required input."],["Scratch logic",null,null,null,null],["Reset, movement, forever loop, conditions, score, and feedback behaviors.",null,null,null,null],[null,14,10,5,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"All 6 required behaviors work together.","4–5 work.","2–3 work.","0–1 works."],["Testing and debugging",null,null,null,null],["Five fixed tests, peer feedback, one correction, and same-condition retest.",null,null,null,null],[null,13,9,5,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"All 5 tests plus feedback, correction, and retest are complete.","4 tests plus correction/retest are complete.","2–3 tests or partial correction evidence.","0–1 test and no usable correction."],["Documentation and reflection",null,null,null,null],["Build log, speaking notes, and five reflection responses.",null,null,null,null],[null,13,9,5,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"All three records are complete and specific.","All are present; one has gaps.","Only one or two are usable.","No usable documentation."],["Live demonstration",null,null,null,null],["90–120 second demo covers goal, controls, logic, test correction, and future step.",null,null,null,null],[null,13,9,5,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"All 5 points are accurate within time and project opens.","4 points are accurate or time is slightly outside range.","2–3 points are usable.","0–1 point is usable or no demo."],["Punctuality, responsibility, and readiness",null,null,null,null],["9 of 90 points: checkpoint readiness, punctual starts, responsible file and material care, milestones, and final handoff. Documented school-controlled failures use the fallback without deduction.",null,null,null,null],[null,9,7,4,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"Device, login, and materials are ready at every checkpoint; starts and milestones are on time; files are organized; final evidence is submitted.","One readiness, punctuality, or milestone issue is corrected after one reminder; final evidence remains checkable.","Readiness or milestone issues repeat, or one session lacks the device or login; some fallback project work is completed.","Readiness is not shown across checkpoints and the approved fallback or final evidence is not completed."]]}
